<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LOWERS KROON BASE INTEREST RATE.</title>
<headline>HANSA LOWERS KROON BASE INTEREST RATE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank said on Tuesday it lowered its base interest rate on kroon loans by one basis point to 12 percent.</p>
<p>It was the second reduction this month by Hansapank of its base interest rate.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newroom, +372 6308 400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
